melyar (0.0.4-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Local music import: .m3u, .pls, .json and .csv can be brought into the
    library from the button in the bottom toolbar.
  * All thirteen locales are back in step with the English dictionary. The
    settings refactor had left eleven of them 106 keys behind, which showed
    up as untranslated accessible labels in the settings panel.
  * The accent colour names are translated strings now rather than hardcoded
    English.
  * The package version follows the changelog again; the stray Version field
    that pinned the binary package to 0.0.3.2a is gone.

